  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The OscilloscopeComponent is a specialized Angular UI visualization layer responsible for rendering real-time audio waveforms using the HTML Canvas API. It consumes time-domain audio data from the AudioService's AnalyserNode to draw a dynamic line graph representing the signal's amplitude over time. It manages its lifecycle by setting up and tearing down the requestAnimationFrame loop and handling canvas resizing events."
  },
